{
  "key": 9218,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_EveryoneKeepsTheirOwnPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone that works in the coal mine\n",
        "keeps their own Pokémon with them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_SomeRocksStartedMoving",
      "en_US": [
        "I found what I thought were some\n",
        "rocks, then they started moving!\r",
        "They were Pokémon that looked just\n",
        "like rocks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_IFoundSomethingInteresting",
      "en_US": [
        "I found something very interesting soon\n",
        "after arrival.\r",
        "You may have it, if you’d like.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_YouHaveAnOverabundance",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh?\n",
        "You have an overabundance of things!\f",
        "I’ll wait for you with this."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_YouMayHaveItIfYoudLike",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello!\r",
        "About that very interesting thing\n",
        "I found...\r",
        "You may have it, if you’d like.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB1F_Text_CreatedAtSameTimeAsSinnoh",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m told that Plate was created at the\n",
        "same time as Sinnoh.\r",
        "I hope we meet again somewhere.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
